# Python tooling scratch, never an artifact of the asset generator.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Signing keys. A key inside a public repository is only a leak when its password is in the same
# repository: that is what made app_pojavlauncher/aerix_release.p12 dangerous, and it is gone.
# The four *.jks files that remain are upstream Pojav's, and each one is useless without a secret
# (POJAV_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD, POJAV_GPLAY_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD and friends) - Android CI legitimately signs
# the Play .aab with one of them, so they stay. Anything NEW must not be added: no .p12 in the tree,
# and never a keystore whose password appears in a build file.
*.p12
*.pkcs12
